# Target: pinned wallabag source in upstream.lock.
# Purpose: Integrate the upstream Redis producer/consumers with Sandstorm background work.
# The producer subscribes the initiating session to import activity; a response subscriber
# ends its publishing marker. Markers expire after crashes. No article data enters notifications.
# The worker keeps failed fetches in Redis instead of silently saving extraction error pages.
# This is scoped to SANDSTORM_IMPORT_WORKER; interactive saves retain upstream semantics.
# The import information panel describes Powerbox approvals and links to queue recovery.
# Upgrade: Recheck producer DI, fetch-error sentinel, form routes and consumer queue names.
# Validation: async import integration tests cover queue persistence, retry and notifications.

